      "created_at": "2013-02-17T12:56:34.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Recent printings of the Enhanced Edition do have this new wording, as someone has mentioned that he purchased a recent copy of the game and saw that it had changed from the original printing of the Enhanced Edition.&nbsp; This was posted hours before Christopher publically posted the errata.&nbsp; So, original runs of Enhanced Edition do not have this change, recent printings do, and I do not know if there is a way to determine the difference.</p>",
